    <h2 id="goals">
      Goals
    </h2>

  <p>
    This brake pedal &amp; carriage design was inherited from GT's 2026 FSAE car, and my goal was to validate the design under new load cases. I worked on analysis of brake pedal and carriage using SolidWorks and Ansys, and derived load cases for floor analysis.
  </p>

    <h2 id="load-cases">
      Load Cases
    </h2>

  <p>
    FSAE rules require that the brake pedal system must withstand a force of 2000 N "panic braking" applied to the pedal. If one master cylinder fails mid-drive, the forces on the carriage increase, so this was also considered.
  </p>

